# master.spec: Memory Palace Live

Single source of truth for the process, decisions, costs and status. Every step taken for this project is recorded here.

## 1. Goal

Turn the 3D Blender memory palace (7 stations, Method of Loci) into a watchable and listenable demo:

- each station gets an exaggerated image, a 5-second video and a spoken narration;
- the public page (`index.html`) shows the cost, lists everything used, explains the technique, and links the stations so the viewer walks them in order;
- total DeepInfra spend must stay **under $2.00**.

## 2. Constraints

| Constraint | Rule |
|---|---|
| Budget | Hard cap $2.00. The generator stops at $1.90 (`HARD_CAP` in `generate_assets.py`). |
| Quality and price | Competitive quality models chosen for price and quality. |
| API key | Read only from the environment variable `DEEPINFRA_API_KEY`. Never written to disk, never committed, never shown on the page. |
| Storage | Large files (`.blend`, full videos, working copies) live on `/Volumes/Samsung/MemoryPalace/`. The repo keeps only the small site assets. |
| Branch | The repo's only branch is `main`, and all work is committed there. (There is no `master` branch in this repo. Creating one would split the history, so it was not done.) |

## 3. Models and prices

Prices come from the DeepInfra listings checked in this session (sources in section 9).

| Use | Model id | Endpoint | Unit price | Why |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| Image | `black-forest-labs/FLUX-2-pro` | `POST /v1/openai/images/generations` | $0.015 / image | Strong quality and prompt following for surreal scenes, at a low price. |
| Video | `Wan-AI/Wan2.2-T2V-A14B` | `POST /v1/inference/Wan-AI/Wan2.2-T2V-A14B` | $0.033 / second | Text-to-video with a 5 s, 720p output at a low per-second price. The cheaper Wan 2.6 is listed at $0.10/s on DeepInfra, so it was rejected. |
| Narration | `hexgrad/Kokoro-82M` | `POST /v1/openai/audio/speech` | per character (tiny) | Very low cost. **Endpoint not yet confirmed on DeepInfra (see section 7).** |

Rejected: `ResembleAI/chatterbox-turbo` (its TTS synthesis endpoint was not documented on the page we could read), and Wan 3.0 (flat $0.20/s).

## 4. Budget

| Item | Qty | Unit | Planned cost |
|---|---|---|---|
| Images | 7 | $0.015 | $0.105 |
| Videos | 7 x 5 s | $0.033/s | $1.155 |
| Narration | 7 clips | upper bound | about $0.005 |
| **Total planned** | | | **$1.265** |
| Headroom under the $2.00 limit | | | $0.735 |

Headroom covers a few retries. The ledger at `/Volumes/Samsung/MemoryPalace/assets/ledger.json` records every paid call, and each call is checked against the guard before it is made. Where DeepInfra returns `inference_status.cost` (video), the actual cost replaces the estimate.

